    "message": "Import urllib3 lazily so a plain install can import lhotse (#1593)\n\nImport urllib3 lazily in AISBatchLoader\n\nlhotse/__init__.py imports lhotse.ais, and batch_loader.py imported\nurllib3 at module level, but urllib3 is not an install requirement (it\nonly comes with the aistore extra). A clean install could not import\nlhotse. Move the import next to the existing lazy aistore import in\n__call__, the only place TimeoutError is used.",
